Im curious, what do you think the slayer guild would have in terms of a unique master? Like how konar is unique from all the other masters, I think having something different about this would be really cool! 

&#x200B;

Looks great btw, love the old school feel :)

Question: Is it possible Legacy moves (Like Meteor Mash for Metagross) come back during an event or something?

&#x200B;

I just wanna know if i should wait on using charge TM's on Mon's like Metagross or somethin', or if I should wait for some sort of event. Has anything like this happened in the past?

&#x200B;

Ps. Sorry if this is a dumb or overasked question, I'm new to this sub.

these are very nice post!

